    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'tional cell distance (ATS\_PERCEL) is not exceeded for any active cell in the grid.  T'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'his time-step constraint will be submitted to the ATS Package, perhaps with constraint'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 's submitted by other packages, in the calculation of the time step.  ATS\_PERCEL must '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'be greater than zero.  If a value of zero is specified for ATS\_PERCEL the program wil'
