    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' If the IDOMAIN value for a cell is 0, the cell does not exist in the simulation.  Inp'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ut and output values will be read and written for the cell, but internal to the progra'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'm, the cell is excluded from the solution.  If the IDOMAIN value for a cell is 1 or gr'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'eater, the cell exists in the simulation.  IDOMAIN values of -1 cannot be specified fo'
