    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' is IAC(n).  This list is sequentially provided for the first to the last cell. The fi'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'rst value in the list must be cell n itself, and the remaining cells must be listed in'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' an increasing order (sorted from lowest number to highest).  Note that the cell and i'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ts connections are only supplied for the GWE cells and their connections to the other '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'GWE cells.  Also note that the JA list input may be divided such that every node and i'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ts connectivity list can be on a separate line for ease in readability of the file. To'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' further ease readability of the file, the node number of the cell whose connectivity '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'is subsequently listed, may be expressed as a negative number, the sign of which is su'
