    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'rmine the temperature of sinks.  If the cell temperature is larger than the user-speci'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'fied auxiliary temperature, then the temperature of groundwater withdrawn from the cel'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'l will be assigned as the user-specified temperature.  Alternatively, if the user-spec'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ified auxiliary temperature is larger than the cell temperature, then groundwater will'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' be withdrawn at the cell temperature.  Thus, the AUXMIXED option is designed to work '
