    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' computed head when head is below the cell top; $<$0 means saturated thickness varies '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'with computed head unless the THICKSTRT option is in effect.  When THICKSTRT is in eff'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ect, a negative value for ICELLTYPE indicates that the saturated thickness value used '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'in conductance calculations in the NPF Package will be computed as STRT-BOT and held c'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'onstant.  If the THICKSTRT option is not in effect, then negative values provided by t'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'he user for ICELLTYPE are automatically reassigned by the program to a value of one.'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') ''
