    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'description is the hydraulic conductivity.  For the common case in which the user woul'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'd like to specify the horizontal hydraulic conductivity and the vertical hydraulic con'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ductivity, then K should be assigned as the horizontal hydraulic conductivity, K33 sho'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'uld be assigned as the vertical hydraulic conductivity, and K22 and the three rotation'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' angles should not be specified.  When more sophisticated anisotropy is required, then'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' K corresponds to the K11 hydraulic conductivity axis.  All included cells (IDOMAIN $>'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') '$ 0) must have a K value greater than zero.'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') ''
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'default_value 1.0'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') ''
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'block griddata'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'name k22'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'type double precision'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'shape (nodes)'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'valid'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'reader readarray'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'layered true'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'netcdf true'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'optional true'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') 'longname hydraulic conductivity of second ellipsoid axis'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'description is the hydraulic conductivity of the second ellipsoid axis (or the ratio o'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'f K22/K if the K22OVERK option is specified); for an unrotated case this is the hydrau'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'lic conductivity in the y direction.  If K22 is not included in the GRIDDATA block, th'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'en K22 is set equal to K.  For a regular MODFLOW grid (DIS Package is used) in which n'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'o rotation angles are specified, K22 is the hydraulic conductivity along columns in th'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'e y direction. For an unstructured DISU grid, the user must assign principal x and y a'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'xes and provide the angle for each cell face relative to the assigned x direction.  Al'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'l included cells (IDOMAIN $>$ 0) must have a K22 value greater than zero.'
    write(output_unit, '(a)') ''
