    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'GWT cells.  Also note that the JA list input may be divided such that every node and i'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ts connectivity list can be on a separate line for ease in readability of the file. To'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' further ease readability of the file, the node number of the cell whose connectivity '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'is subsequently listed, may be expressed as a negative number, the sign of which is su'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'bsequently converted to positive by the code.'
