    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') '-transient continuation (PTC). FIRST is an optional keyword to disable PTC for the fir'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'st stress period, if steady-state and one or more model is using the Newton-Raphson fo'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'rmulation. ALL is an optional keyword to disable PTC for all steady-state stress perio'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ds for models using the Newton-Raphson formulation. If NO\_PTC\_OPTION is not specifie'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'd, the NO\_PTC ALL option is used.'
