    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' (nonlinear) iterations, in units of length. When the maximum absolute value of the he'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ad change at all nodes during an iteration is less than or equal to OUTER\_HCLOSE, ite'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ration stops. Commonly, OUTER\_HCLOSE equals 0.01.  The OUTER\_HCLOSE option has been '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'deprecated in favor of the more general OUTER\_DVCLOSE (for dependent variable), howev'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'er either one can be specified in order to maintain backward compatibility.'
