    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'description real value defining the dependent-variable (for example, head) change crit'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'erion for convergence of the outer (nonlinear) iterations, in units of the dependent-v'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ariable (for example, length for head). When the maximum absolute value of the depende'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'nt-variable change at all nodes during an iteration is less than or equal to OUTER\_DV'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'CLOSE, iteration stops. Commonly, OUTER\_DVCLOSE equals 0.01. The keyword, OUTER\_HCLO'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'SE can be still be specified instead of OUTER\_DVCLOSE for backward compatibility with'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') ' previous versions of MODFLOW 6 but eventually OUTER\_HCLOSE will be deprecated and sp'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'ecification of OUTER\_HCLOSE will cause MODFLOW 6 to terminate with an error.'
