    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'and nonlinear residual reduction summaries. ALL means print linear matrix solver conve'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'rgence information to the solution listing file and model specific linear matrix solve'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'r convergence information to each model listing file in addition to SUMMARY informatio'
