    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 's (OUTER\_MAXIMUM) and ATS\_OUTER\_MAXIMUM\_FRACTION (an optional variable in the IMS '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'input file with a default value of 1/3), then the time step length is multiplied by dt'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'adj.  If the number of outer solver iterations are greater than the product of the max'
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'imum number of outer iterations and 1.0 minus ATS\_OUTER\_MAXIMUM\_FRACTION, then the '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'time step length is divided by dtadj.  dtadj must be zero, one, or greater than one.  '
    write(output_unit, '(a)', advance='no') 'If dtadj is zero or one, then it has no effect on the simulation.  A value between 2.0'
